# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Meta-Pro frontend environment (Vite)
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. For production, set these in
# Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the deployed FastAPI backend (Render), **including the `/api`
# path prefix**. The app appends `/generate/stream` to this value (see
# src/services/api.ts), so VITE_API_BASE_URL must point at the API root:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<service-name>.onrender.com/api
# A bare origin (https://<service-name>.onrender.com) will call
# /generate/stream and get a FastAPI 404 "Not Found". When unset, calls go to
# the local `/api` Vite dev proxy (see frontend/vite.config.ts).
# Replace with your actual Render service URL:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://meta-pro-backend.onrender.com/api
